# Release Metadata

This folder stores the release metadata used by `dy-cli version` and `dy-cli publish`.

For day-to-day work, stay on the `dy-cli` command flow:

- `dy-cli version`
- `dy-cli version --beta`
- `dy-cli version --beta-exit`
- `dy-cli publish`

The files in this folder are internal release inputs for the monorepo workflow.
